{{ blueprint.security_compliance or "Security requirements not yet defined." }}

## Principles

- Least privilege — services only access what they need
- Secrets in environment variables, never in code
- Input validation on all public endpoints
- Audit log for sensitive operations
- Dependencies pinned and regularly updated

## Authentication

- JWTs expire in 1 hour, refresh tokens in 30 days
- Rotate secrets on suspected compromise

## Data

- PII encrypted at rest
- HTTPS everywhere
- No sensitive data in logs
